1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,409
Tomorrow's explanation should remember
today's struggle.

2
00:00:03,409 --> 00:00:07,386
In Venezuela, UNICEF's twenty twenty-five
report estimated

3
00:00:07,386 --> 00:00:11,932
two point seven million children needing
educational support

4
00:00:11,932 --> 00:00:16,477
and one point five million out of school.

5
00:00:16,477 --> 00:00:21,591
Its education response required
twenty-three point seven million dollars,

6
00:00:21,591 --> 00:00:25,000
with a seventy-seven percent funding gap.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
We built Repaso, School Community Memory,

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,500
to keep learning support connected between
meetings.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:37,500
Building it also led to two upstream
Strands Agents bug-fix pull requests,

10
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,500
covering model telemetry and streaming
compatibility.

11
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,000
Both remain open for review.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,125
Start with a family, a topic and a day.

13
00:00:47,125 --> 00:00:51,250
See assessed answers, distinct questions
and stored review dates.

14
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:54,000
Open the episode. Three synchronized
columns

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,833
reveal the retained conversation,

16
00:00:55,833 --> 00:00:59,958
the agent's actions and memory, and the
learning evidence.

17
00:00:59,958 --> 00:01:05,000
This is our recorded Telegram interaction,
connected to its AWS records.

18
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,286
The learner asks for help with equivalent
fractions.

19
00:01:09,286 --> 00:01:14,107
Repaso explains with a cake and remembers
that approach.

20
00:01:14,107 --> 00:01:18,393
Then: “I still don't understand. Use
another example.”

21
00:01:18,393 --> 00:01:23,214
Watch the memory column. One previous
approach was retrieved.

22
00:01:23,214 --> 00:01:26,429
The new explanation uses folded paper.

23
00:01:26,429 --> 00:01:33,393
Its approach is saved, and the reply is
linked to its delivery record.

24
00:01:33,393 --> 00:01:37,143
Two successful help requests. Two
remembered explanations.

25
00:01:37,143 --> 00:01:40,357
The assessed-answer count stays at three.

26
00:01:40,357 --> 00:01:45,179
Asking for help does not become a wrong
answer.

27
00:01:45,179 --> 00:01:50,000
Select either message. The evidence
follows that exact turn.

28
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,387
Those three earlier answers repeated one
question.

29
00:01:53,387 --> 00:01:56,290
They do not prove learning improvement.

30
00:01:56,290 --> 00:01:59,194
Read the memory again. It persists.

31
00:01:59,194 --> 00:02:03,548
Strands coordinates the agent workflows on
Amazon Bedrock AgentCore.

32
00:02:03,548 --> 00:02:06,935
Four workflows handle material intake,
practice planning,

33
00:02:06,935 --> 00:02:10,806
responses and daily review, with explicit
state transitions.

34
00:02:10,806 --> 00:02:14,194
DynamoDB preserves application memory and
learning evidence.

35
00:02:14,194 --> 00:02:16,613
The demonstrated gain is continuity:

36
00:02:16,613 --> 00:02:20,000
the next explanation uses what happened
before.

37
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,186
Our Good Neighbor proposal supports
community facilitators and families

38
00:02:24,186 --> 00:02:26,977
between meetings, starting with
fourth-grade mathematics.

39
00:02:26,977 --> 00:02:31,628
A human can follow the evidence,
understand what was tried,

40
00:02:31,628 --> 00:02:33,953
and choose the next step.

41
00:02:33,953 --> 00:02:35,814
Try the public demo.

42
00:02:35,814 --> 00:02:40,000
Repaso keeps the conversation connected to
what comes next.
